{"strongs": "H4974", "word": "מְתֹם", "translit": "me.tom", "root": "מתם", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "soundness", "definition": "מְתֹם noun [masculine] soundness ; in phrase ׳ אֵין מְתֹם ב Isa 1:6 ; Ps 38:4 ; Ps 38:8 מֵעִיר מְ֯תֹם Judg 20:48 from entire city (Manuscripts De Rossi Bu GFM מְתִם , see מַת and compare עיר מת(י)ם Deut 2:34 ; Deut 3:6 ; Job 24:12 ). תֵּמָן , תֵּמָנִי see תֵּימָן below ימן . תִּמְנָה , תִּמְנָ֫תָה , תִּמְנִי , תִּמְנַת see מנה . תִּמְנָע see מָנַע . תֶּ֫מֶס see מסס .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9194')\">BDB9194</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4974')\">H4974</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H4962')\">H4962</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9193')\">BDB9193</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9195')\">BDB9195</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מְתֹם</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>soundness</highlightword>; in phrase <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֵין מְתֹם ב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 1:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,6)\">Isa 1:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 38:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,38,4)\">Ps 38:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 38:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,38,8)\">Ps 38:8</ref> <bdbheb>מֵעִיר מְ֯תֹם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 20:48\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"48\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"48\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,48)\">Judg 20:48</ref> <highlight>from entire city</highlight> (Manuscripts <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup> Rossi <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bu')\">Bu</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GFM')\">GFM</lookup> <bdbheb>מְתִם</bdbheb>, see  <bdbheb><reflink>מַת</reflink></bdbheb> and compare <bdbheb>עיר מת(י)ם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 2:34\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(5,2,34)\">Deut 2:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 3:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"6